1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,396
Have you ever tried

2
00:00:01,443 --> 00:00:03,202
the same thing a hundred

3
00:00:03,249 --> 00:00:04,880
times, and still ended

4
00:00:04,927 --> 00:00:06,449
up in the same place?

5
00:00:06,496 --> 00:00:07,923
That frustration is

6
00:00:07,970 --> 00:00:09,336
real — but the real

7
00:00:09,384 --> 00:00:10,907
problem is not a lack

8
00:00:10,954 --> 00:00:12,397
of effort. It is the

9
00:00:12,444 --> 00:00:13,871
hidden cause behind

10
00:00:13,918 --> 00:00:15,393
the effort, the part

11
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:16,758
we rarely look at.
